            "review_title": "Review at Trung Nguyen Coffee",
            "review_text": "David S\n2 contributions\n0\nSmoking inside.\nSep 2017 • Solo\nVisit here for a coffee while my wife in at Cho Tan Dinh, too hot for me inside. Was welcomed by a waiter and ordered a strong coffee. To my surprise the men at the table next to me started smoking. Filthy disgusting smoking inside a closed door air-conditioned venue. Will frequent Highlands Coffee from now on with cheaper coffee and better food.\nWritten September 26, 2017",
