            "review_text": "hurleyswork\n157 contributions\n0\nGood\nMay 2017 • Solo\nA big fan of the coffee here. You have to be careful in Vietnam with all of the fake coffee being sold. After I visited the Tring Nguyen Village in Buon Ma Thuot I became an instant fan of the coffee this company offers. Only problem is it takes forever to get your coffee compared to other spots.\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten May 20, 2017",
